WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Most AI tools start with an empty chat. StatePort
starts with an app for work you want to continue.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:18.318
Your goal, files, decisions, history, and AI
conversations stay together.

00:00:19.068 --> 00:00:26.268
You can ask an AI coding helper a normal question, or
let it prepare useful work.

00:00:27.018 --> 00:00:41.778
When AI runs code, StatePort limits where it can work
and what it can do. A container is one option, not a
promise that the whole service lives inside one.

00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:50.174
Routine work can keep moving. Important changes stay
visible for you to review.

00:00:50.918 --> 00:00:56.726
Close it. Return later. The app still knows what you
were doing.

00:00:57.476 --> 00:01:05.372
StatePort gives ongoing AI work a home you can
inspect, control, and keep.
